msgid "evidence_tasks.csv lists current unmet requirements with responsible roles and actions. Assignment, evidence and human decisions remain blank. media_requirements.csv identifies the exact media and documentary gaps without exporting contracts or account identities. Recheck the live CMS before recording any decision: this download is a dated snapshot."
